# Engine build pins. DOCUMENTDB_TAG / ICU_MAJOR / HARDENED_BASE_18 are kept in lockstep with
# the other artifacts by build/common/check-pins.sh. Bases are upstream CloudNativePG
# standard-trixie images; ICU_MAJOR must equal the base's (Debian trixie) ICU major.
